# Payroll Automation System

## Project overview

This project automates payroll processing for a part-time and incentive-based workforce.

The business workflow is:

Roster Import → Timesheet Validation → Payroll Calculation → Payroll Approval → Payment Processing

The application is developed as a Nanyang Polytechnic Full Stack Application Development group project.

## Technology stack

### Frontend

- React.js
- Vite
- JavaScript
- Material UI
