http://localhost:5000/api/health
```

## Testing

Run backend tests:

```bash
npm test
```

Run tests with coverage:

```bash
npm run test:coverage
```

Build the frontend:

```bash
npm run build:frontend
```

## Database commands

Sequelize migration and seeding commands will be enabled after the shared model contracts are finalised.

Planned commands:

```bash
npm run db:migrate --prefix backend
npm run db:seed --prefix backend
```

Do not use `sequelize.sync({ alter: true })` as the production migration strategy.

## Authentication

The application will support these roles:

- `payroll_admin`
- `manager`
- `employee`

Authentication test accounts will be documented after the authentication seeders are implemented.

## Mock HRMS

The real Infotech HRMS API is unavailable.

Development uses a replaceable mock HRMS adapter:

```env
HRMS_MODE=mock
HRMS_SIMULATE_FAILURE=false
```

Changing `HRMS_SIMULATE_FAILURE` to `true` will support testing the HRMS failure and retry workflow.

## Payment files

Payment files are generated from final approved net-pay values.

Payment files:

- Require payroll-administrator authorisation
- Are not exposed through public static URLs
- Are audit logged when downloaded
- Are not committed to Git
- Do not expose full bank accounts in ordinary JSON responses

## PDF documents

PDFKit will generate:

- Employee payslips
- Client invoices

Payslips must not display full bank-account numbers. Employees may access only their own payslips.

## Deployment plan

Planned services:

- Frontend: Vercel
- Backend: Render
- Database: Neon PostgreSQL

Public deployment URLs will be added when available.

## Security notes

- Passwords are hashed using bcrypt.
- JWT secrets and database credentials are environment variables.
- Sensitive routes require authentication and role checks.
- Bank account numbers are masked in normal API responses.
- Financial records use soft cancellation rather than permanent deletion.
- Generated financial files are not stored in public directories.
- Production errors do not expose stack traces.
- Sensitive request bodies are not logged.

## Known limitations

- Infotech HRMS is represented by a mock adapter.
- The final banking platform format must be confirmed with the client.
- Deployment URLs are not available yet.
- Shared Sequelize models and migrations will be finalised during the database-design phase.
```

